    "summary": "assessDesignResult refuses with invalid_result a chunk result that carries findings but an empty inspectedReferences, before the coverage limitations are added, so the findings never reach consolidation. An honest incomplete (no findings, nothing inspected) and a partially inspected result with findings stay valid. New test in policy-results.test.ts (fails without the fix); the coordinator.test.ts fixture for findings plus verification gaps now inspects one reference (it used to report a finding with nothing inspected). The 83 design-review tests pass. Left out: part 1 of #101.",
